title: "Temporal Frame Prediction in Simulated Dynamic PET"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark of 14 predictive models for forecasting future frames of a
  simulated dynamic 18F-FDG PET time series, evaluated with
  leave-one-tumour-out cross-validation.
